    <string name="how_t">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_b">You assemble the matryoshka from the outside in. Each figure holds a note, a photo or a voice and has a lock. The smallest one is solid and holds the present itself. A sealed matryoshka is a single file: send it in any messenger. Riddles and code words are real encryption: without the answer the file can’t be opened, even taken apart.</string>
